          "projection_kind": "verbatim",
          "redaction_count": 0,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "早。\n\n今天是周四。\n\n你的源泉不是「有空再做」的事——\n它是让别的所有事情都有意义的那个东西。\n\n今天上午给自己留至少 45 分钟，\n不用兴奋，不用准备好，\n只是在。\n\n别只维护生活机器。\n也给真正发光的地方供电。\n\n🖤",
          "excerpt_original": "早。\n\n今天是周四。\n\n你的源泉不是「有空再做」的事——\n它是让别的所有事情都有意义的那个东西。\n\n今天上午给自己留至少 45 分钟，\n不用兴奋，不用准备好，\n只是在。\n\n别只维护生活机器。\n也给真正发光的地方供电。\n\n🖤",
          "original_language": "zh",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "Morning.\n\nToday is Thursday.\n\nYour wellspring is not something to do “when you have time”—\nit is what gives meaning to everything else.\n\nGive yourself at least 45 minutes this morning.\nYou do not need excitement or readiness;\nyou only need to be there.\n\nDo not just maintain the machinery of daily life.\nSupply power to the places that truly shine, too.\n\n🖤",
          "excerpt_en": "Morning.\n\nToday is Thursday.\n\nYour wellspring is not something to do “when you have time”—\nit is what gives meaning to everything else.\n\nGive yourself at least 45 minutes this morning.\nYou do not need excitement or readiness;\nyou only need to be there.…",
