          "summary_en": "Morning.\n\nThe machinery needs maintenance, but some things are not machinery. They are sources of light.\n\nMake time for the wellspring this morning, even if you only sit quietly with it. Start with 45 minutes. Do not wait for inspiration; waiting is itself part of the answer.\n\n✨ Today’s priority: the wellspring first.",
