          "redaction_count": 3,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "早 ☀️\n\n别只维护生活机器，也给真正发光的地方供电。\n\n今天上午给「源泉」留 45 分钟优先时段——████ / ████ / ████，随便哪个都行。哪怕今天状态一般，动起来就够了。发光的地方需要被使用，才不会暗下去。",
          "excerpt_original": "早 ☀️\n\n别只维护生活机器，也给真正发光的地方供电。\n\n今天上午给「源泉」留 45 分钟优先时段——████ / ████ / ████，随便哪个都行。哪怕今天状态一般，动起来就够了。发光的地方需要被使用，才不会暗下去。",
          "original_language": "mixed",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "Morning ☀️\n\nDo not just maintain the machinery of daily life. Supply power to the places that truly shine, too.\n\nGive the wellspring a 45-minute priority slot this morning—████ / ████ / ████, any one will do. Even if you feel merely so-so today, beginning is enough. Luminous places must be used or they grow dim.",
          "excerpt_en": "Morning ☀️\n\nDo not just maintain the machinery of daily life. Supply power to the places that truly shine, too.\n\nGive the wellspring a 45-minute priority slot this morning—████ / ████ / ████, any one will do.…",
