          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "The wellspring.\n\nOne question is enough: did you give it power today?\n\nIf not, that is what happened. Spend 20 minutes making up one tiny action—even if you only open the project for a glance, change one parameter, or save one frame of a sketch. You can stare into space for an hour if you like, but do it in front of the wellspring.\n\nThere is one thing you can do tonight. Go do it.",
