          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "The wellspring will not generate power on its own.\n\nDid you supply it with power today?\n\nIf not, take 20 minutes tonight: write one line of a prompt, publish one image, organize one note, or think through one question. The smallest action is enough. The current only needs to flow.",
          "excerpt_en": "The wellspring will not generate power on its own.\n\nDid you supply it with power today?\n\nIf not, take 20 minutes tonight: write one line of a prompt, publish one image, organize one note, or think through one question. The smallest action is enough.…",
