          "projection_kind": "verbatim",
          "redaction_count": 0,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "早。\n\n生活机器今天也会转。\n\n但别忘了——今天要给源泉留一个上午时段，至少 45 分钟。不需要兴奋，不需要准备好，去了就行。\n\n别只维护机器，也给真正发光的地方供电。",
          "excerpt_original": "早。\n\n生活机器今天也会转。\n\n但别忘了——今天要给源泉留一个上午时段，至少 45 分钟。不需要兴奋，不需要准备好，去了就行。\n\n别只维护机器，也给真正发光的地方供电。",
          "original_language": "zh",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "Morning.\n\nThe machinery of daily life will keep turning today.\n\nBut remember to reserve a morning slot for the wellspring—at least 45 minutes. You do not need to feel excited or ready. Just show up.\n\nDo not merely maintain the machinery. Power the places that truly shine, too.",
          "excerpt_en": "Morning.\n\nThe machinery of daily life will keep turning today.\n\nBut remember to reserve a morning slot for the wellspring—at least 45 minutes. You do not need to feel excited or ready. Just show up.\n\nDo not merely maintain the machinery.…",
