          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "The wellspring does not need to wait until you finish everything else.\n\nIt only asks for 20 minutes each day.\n\nDid you supply power to ████ / ████ / ████ today?\n\nIf not, close the other windows tonight and give it one tiny action.",
