          "projection_kind": "verbatim",
          "redaction_count": 0,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "早。\n\n机器醒了，但你醒了吗？\n\n今天是周三。别只忙着让生活的机器转起来——那些事永远有，永远紧急。\n\n今天给「源泉」留一个上午的优先时段，45 分钟起。不需要兴奋，不需要准备好，只需要人在。\n\n有些东西不喂它，它就暗了。\n\n去吧。✨",
          "excerpt_original": "早。\n\n机器醒了，但你醒了吗？\n\n今天是周三。别只忙着让生活的机器转起来——那些事永远有，永远紧急。\n\n今天给「源泉」留一个上午的优先时段，45 分钟起。不需要兴奋，不需要准备好，只需要人在。\n\n有些东西不喂它，它就暗了。\n\n去吧。✨",
          "original_language": "zh",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "Morning.\n\nThe machinery is awake, but are you?\n\nIt is Monday. Do not spend all your energy getting the machinery of daily life moving; those tasks are endless and always urgent.\n\nGive the wellspring a priority slot this morning—at least 45 minutes. You do not need excitement or readiness. You only need to be there.\n\nSome things go dark when they are not fed.\n\nGo. ✨",
          "excerpt_en": "Morning.\n\nThe machinery is awake, but are you?\n\nIt is Monday. Do not spend all your energy getting the machinery of daily life moving; those tasks are endless and always urgent.\n\nGive the wellspring a priority slot this morning—at least 45 minutes.…",
