          "projection_kind": "verbatim",
          "redaction_count": 0,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "早安 ☀️\n\n今天记得给「源泉」留一块时间——不需要兴奋，不需要意义感，先坐到它面前。\n\n45 分钟也行，半小时也好。别让那件事永远排在「等我有空」的后面。\n\n机器要维护，但你真正发光的那个角落，也得有人记得去供电。早上是个好时候。🖤",
          "excerpt_original": "早安 ☀️\n\n今天记得给「源泉」留一块时间——不需要兴奋，不需要意义感，先坐到它面前。\n\n45 分钟也行，半小时也好。别让那件事永远排在「等我有空」的后面。\n\n机器要维护，但你真正发光的那个角落，也得有人记得去供电。早上是个好时候。🖤",
          "original_language": "zh",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "Good morning ☀️\n\nRemember to make a little time for the wellspring today. You do not need excitement or a sense of meaning; just sit down in front of it first.\n\nForty-five minutes is enough, or even half an hour. Do not let it remain forever behind “when I have time.”\n\nThe machinery needs maintenance, but someone also has to remember to power the corner where you truly shine. Morning is a good time for that. 🖤",
          "excerpt_en": "Good morning ☀️\n\nRemember to make a little time for the wellspring today. You do not need excitement or a sense of meaning; just sit down in front of it first.\n\nForty-five minutes is enough, or even half an hour.…",
