          "projection_kind": "verbatim",
          "redaction_count": 0,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "**傍晚·源泉提醒**\n\n源泉不是工具，是你呼吸的方式。\n\n今天有没有给它供电？\n\n没有的话，今晚 20 分钟，画一张、跑一趟模型、写一段 prompt——随便什么，最小动作就行。\n\n不是为了完成什么，是为了让自己记得，你还在活着的地方。",
          "excerpt_original": "**傍晚·源泉提醒**\n\n源泉不是工具，是你呼吸的方式。\n\n今天有没有给它供电？\n\n没有的话，今晚 20 分钟，画一张、跑一趟模型、写一段 prompt——随便什么，最小动作就行。\n\n不是为了完成什么，是为了让自己记得，你还在活着的地方。",
          "original_language": "mixed",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "**Evening · Wellspring Reminder**\n\nThe wellspring is not a tool. It is how you breathe.\n\nDid you give it power today?\n\nIf not, spend 20 minutes tonight drawing an image, running a model, or writing a prompt—anything at all, as long as the action is small.\n\nThis is not about finishing something. It is about reminding yourself that you are still present in the place where you feel alive.",
          "excerpt_en": "**Evening · Wellspring Reminder**\n\nThe wellspring is not a tool. It is how you breathe.\n\nDid you give it power today?\n\nIf not, spend 20 minutes tonight drawing an image, running a model, or writing a prompt—anything at all, as long as the action is small.…",
