          "projection_kind": "verbatim",
          "redaction_count": 0,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "早。\n\n机器跑着，你也在喂它。\n但今天，别只当维修工。\n\n源泉那边还有一扇门——\n推开了，里面才是你真正发光的地方。\n\n上午，45分钟，关掉通知，\n只和那件事待在一起。不必兴奋，\n只是在就好。\n\n今天优先给那一块供电。🏛️",
          "excerpt_original": "早。\n\n机器跑着，你也在喂它。\n但今天，别只当维修工。\n\n源泉那边还有一扇门——\n推开了，里面才是你真正发光的地方。\n\n上午，45分钟，关掉通知，\n只和那件事待在一起。不必兴奋，\n只是在就好。\n\n今天优先给那一块供电。🏛️",
          "original_language": "zh",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "Morning.\n\nThe machinery is running, and you are feeding it.\nBut today, do not be only its mechanic.\n\nThere is another door by the wellspring—\npush it open, and beyond it is where you truly shine.\n\nThis morning, take 45 minutes, turn off notifications,\nand stay with that one thing. You do not need excitement;\nyou only need to be there.\n\nPower that place first today. 🏛️",
