          "redaction_count": 0,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "🌙 晚安 · 2026年6月30日\n\n今天是你六月的最后一个夜晚。没有记录今天发生的事，但六月过完了——这本身就值得一个安静的停顿。\n\n明天是七月第一天，新的月份通常会带来一点\"重新开始\"的引力。如果有什么想推进的，早起那一刻最清醒。\n\n晚安，好好休息。",
          "excerpt_original": "🌙 晚安 · 2026年6月30日\n\n今天是你六月的最后一个夜晚。没有记录今天发生的事，但六月过完了——这本身就值得一个安静的停顿。\n\n明天是七月第一天，新的月份通常会带来一点\"重新开始\"的引力。如果有什么想推进的，早起那一刻最清醒。\n\n晚安，好好休息。",
          "original_language": "zh",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "🌙 Good night · June 30, 2026\n\nThis is your last night of June. There is no record of what happened today, but June is ending—and that alone deserves a quiet pause.\n\nTomorrow is the first day of July. A new month usually exerts a gentle pull toward “starting again.” If there is something you want to move forward, the moment just after you wake early is when your mind is clearest.\n\nGood night. Rest well.",
          "excerpt_en": "🌙 Good night · June 30, 2026\n\nThis is your last night of June. There is no record of what happened today, but June is ending—and that alone deserves a quiet pause.\n\nTomorrow is the first day of July.…",
