          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "Morning.\n\nRemember to make time for the wellspring today.\n\nDo not wait until you are free or in the right state of mind. Give it a priority slot—at least 45 minutes. You cross the gray zone not by waiting for excitement, but by sitting down and being there.\n\nDo not just maintain the machinery of daily life. Supply power to the places that truly shine. 🌊",
