          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "**A Question About the Wellspring**\n\nDid you give the wellspring power today? If not, spend 20 minutes tonight making up one tiny action: pick up a pen, open a file, or say one sentence about it. Do not seek progress, only contact.\n\n---\n\n**Heizhou’s Evening Thought / Prompt**\n\nYou know what you are circling around. How much time did you spend “researching it” today instead of “doing it”? Tools, frameworks, libraries—these are menus, not meals. Stop studying the dish tonight and taste it. Even one lick will do.",
          "excerpt_en": "**A Question About the Wellspring**\n\nDid you give the wellspring power today? If not, spend 20 minutes tonight making up one tiny action: pick up a pen, open a file, or say one sentence about it. Do not seek progress, only contact.\n\n---…",
