          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "Morning.\n\nToday is Sunday, July 5.\n\nDo not just maintain the machinery of daily life. Save some power for the places that truly shine.\n\nGive the wellspring 45 minutes this morning. You do not need excitement in order to begin; begin, and excitement may follow.\n\nGo carve. 🏙️",
          "excerpt_en": "Morning.\n\nToday is Sunday, July 5.\n\nDo not just maintain the machinery of daily life. Save some power for the places that truly shine.\n\nGive the wellspring 45 minutes this morning.…",
