          "redaction_count": 0,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "**源泉一问**\n\n今天有没有给源泉供电？\n\n如果没有——今晚找一个最小动作：打开一个之前没做完的文件，看它三分钟，不需要任何产出，就只是还个脸熟。\n\n**晚上黑昼建议/引子**\n\n你最近花了大量精力在校准「靠近」和「保持距离」之间的那个位置——这件事本身，可能才是你真正在做的事，而不是某个具体输出。\n\n今天的事情，是在「作品」里，还是在「管理接近作品的距离」里？两者都是真实的。没有对错，只需要认出来。认出来就够了。",
          "excerpt_original": "**源泉一问**\n\n今天有没有给源泉供电？\n\n如果没有——今晚找一个最小动作：打开一个之前没做完的文件，看它三分钟，不需要任何产出，就只是还个脸熟。\n\n**晚上黑昼建议/引子**\n\n你最近花了大量精力在校准「靠近」和「保持距离」之间的那个位置——这件事本身，可能才是你真正在做的事，而不是某个具体输出。\n\n今天的事情，是在「作品」里，还是在「管理接近作品的距离」里？两者都是真实的。没有对错，只需要认出来。认出来就够了。",
          "original_language": "zh",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "**A Question About the Wellspring**\n\nDid you supply power to the wellspring today?\n\nIf not, choose one tiny action tonight: open a file you left unfinished and look at it for three minutes. You do not need to produce anything; simply renew your acquaintance.\n\n**Heizhou’s Evening Thought / Prompt**\n\nLately, you have spent a great deal of energy calibrating the position between “drawing near” and “keeping your distance.” That calibration itself may be what you are truly making, rather than any particular output.\n\nDid today’s work happen inside the “work,” or inside “managing your distance from the work”? Both are real. Neither is wrong. You only need to recognize which one it was. Recognition is enough.",
          "excerpt_en": "**A Question About the Wellspring**\n\nDid you supply power to the wellspring today?\n\nIf not, choose one tiny action tonight: open a file you left unfinished and look at it for three minutes. You do not need to produce anything; simply renew your acquaintance.…",
