          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "Good morning, ████.\n\nGive the wellspring at least 45 minutes this morning.\nDo not wait for inspiration. Recharge the place that truly shines—some small part of ████, ████, or any ████ that you want to move forward.\n\nThe machinery can wait for maintenance. Let the light in early.",
          "excerpt_en": "Good morning, ████.\n\nGive the wellspring at least 45 minutes this morning.\nDo not wait for inspiration. Recharge the place that truly shines—some small part of ████, ████, or any ████ that you want to move forward.\n\nThe machinery can wait for maintenance.…",
