          "redaction_count": 0,
          "semantic_abstraction_count": 0,
          "summary_original": "🌙 晚安 · 2026年7月16日\n\n今天最值得记住的，不是抓到了多少信号，而是在网络全面失灵时，你仍把“已确认”和“待验证”分开了——这比硬凑完整更专业。  \n今晚别替网络故障值夜班，休息本身也是系统维护。  \n明早只做一个轻启动：先打通出站 HTTPS，再继续后面的判断。",
          "excerpt_original": "🌙 晚安 · 2026年7月16日\n\n今天最值得记住的，不是抓到了多少信号，而是在网络全面失灵时，你仍把“已确认”和“待验证”分开了——这比硬凑完整更专业。  \n今晚别替网络故障值夜班，休息本身也是系统维护。  \n明早只做一个轻启动：先打通出站 HTTPS，再继续后面的判断。",
          "original_language": "mixed",
          "disclosure_policy": "semantic_abstraction_entity_masked_reminder_v3",
          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "🌙 Good night · July 16, 2026\n\nWhat is most worth remembering today is not how many signals you found, but that when the network failed completely, you still kept “confirmed” separate from “awaiting verification.” That is more professional than forcing an illusion of completeness.  \nDo not stand the night shift for a network failure tonight. Rest is system maintenance too.  \nTomorrow morning, make just one gentle start: restore outbound HTTPS first, then continue with the later judgments.",
          "excerpt_en": "🌙 Good night · July 16, 2026\n\nWhat is most worth remembering today is not how many signals you found, but that when the network failed completely, you still kept “confirmed” separate from “awaiting verification.…",
