          "disclosure_authorization": "explicit_user_authorization_2026-07-29",
          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "☀️ 09:15\n\nMorning, ████.\n\nThe machinery can wait. The wellspring cannot.\n\nReserve a **45-minute priority slot** this morning for ████ / ████ / ████. You do not need to feel excited or produce anything. You only need to **be there**.\n\nThe gray-zone practice is this: even when you feel nothing, show up on time and supply power to the places that truly shine.\n\nWhen the time comes, open it. Do not negotiate with life’s clutter. 🪞",
          "excerpt_en": "☀️ 09:15\n\nMorning, ████.\n\nThe machinery can wait. The wellspring cannot.\n\nReserve a **45-minute priority slot** this morning for ████ / ████ / ████. You do not need to feel excited or produce anything. You only need to **be there**.…",
