          "projection_provenance": "semantic_public_projection",
          "summary_en": "🌙 Good night · July 22, 2026\n\nThere are no unresolved matters hanging over the desk tonight. That is a rare state. Let the day end cleanly. Do not take the screen’s residual glow to bed; your mind needs clearing even more than your notes do. Tomorrow, whether you want to move forward one sentence, one thought, or an entire project, I will be here.",
